<title>UK: Rentokil pretax profit jumps.</title>
<headline>Rentokil pretax profit jumps.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31.</p>
<p>(millions stg unless stated)</p>
<p>     Shr (pence)	    17.13	 vs  14.22</p>
<p>     Dividend (pence)	5.06	 vs  4.20</p>
<p>     Pretax profit	   318	  vs  214.5</p>
<p>     Turnover		 2,340	  vs  874.5</p>
<p>NOTE -- analysts had mostly expected pretax profits to be in a range between 317 million stg and 335 million stg. The dividend was expected at between 5.0p and 5.1p. The latest figures include eight months results from BET Plc, acquired during the past year. Rentokil said the results had been affected by exceptional integration costs of 16.4 million stg, by management being diverted to integration tasks and by adverse exchange rates.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
